d <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{\\upharpoonright}\">\\({\\upharpoonright}\\)</span> the sourced function-restriction operation</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}body\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S(B,T,A)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\land B\\subseteq A^\\omega\\land\\forall x\\in A^\\omega\\;\\bigl(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}body\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S(B,T,A)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\land B\\subseteq A^\\omega\\land\\forall x\\in A^\\omega\\;\\bigl(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The alphabet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and prefix closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> are explicit; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=[T]\">\\(B=[T]\\)</span> is therefore uniquely determined.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree-—-ZFC-Tree11-Body-Of-Tree","text":"df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree — ZFC Tree11 Body Of Tree","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","lev